+"""tarx — a standard-library-only CLI for listing and extracting tar archives.
+
+Package marker only; nothing executable lives here. The command-line entry point is
+``tarx.__main__`` (``python -m tarx``), argument handling and stream writing live in
+``tarx.cli``, and archive reading, validation and writing live in ``tarx.core``.
+"""
